Add support for the file:// URL scheme via requests_file's FileAdapter,
so the index/package URL can point at a local on-disk PyPI mirror
instead of only a remote HTTP(S) index.

requests_file >= 2.1.0 is required: earlier releases don't set
Response.request in FileAdapter.send(), so _cache.py's use of
response.request.url raises AttributeError: 'NoneType' object has
no attribute 'url'.

Obtained from: https://github.com/michael-o/proxpi/commit/14ea92360f051723f415e9c2d622d07a18946ff1

